<!DOCTYPE concept PUBLIC "-//OASIS//DTD DITA 1.3 Concept//EN" "concept.dtd">
<concept base="Anywhere" importance="optional" id="t00662">
	<title>Based on Driving Style operating</title>
	<conbody>
		<table frame="none" colsep="1" rowsep="1" outputclass="formatc_none">
			<tgroup cols="2" colsep="1" rowsep="1" outputclass="formatc">
				<colspec colnum="1" colname="1" colwidth="50*"/>
				<colspec colnum="2" colname="2" colwidth="50*"/>
				<tbody>
					<row rowsep="0">
						<entry colname="1" colsep="0">
							<fig>
								<figgroup>
									<image href="../../images/N_CT25Z108.eps" scale="95" align="center" placement="break"/>
								</figgroup>
							</fig>
						</entry>
						<entry colname="2">
							<p>When the Based on Driving Style is enabled, the cluster will show the set vehicle distance level and target vehicle distance in white. It will also display the distance level and target distance based on the driver’s driving behavior.</p>
						</entry>
					</row>
				</tbody>
			</tgroup>
		</table>
	</conbody>
</concept>